{"ID":"20240220132604-j0xirnw","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132604-j0xirnw","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132604-j0xirnw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171435-t4b82dw\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171512-58fr7xi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:301,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312171512-58fr7xi\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:30,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:30\u0026#125;","title":"【桃花汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312171512"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312171435-t4b82dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-t4b82dw","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百二十条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171435-io7atdq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-io7atdq","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：【少阴病】，下利便脓血者，【桃花汤】主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171435-hxkzznj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-hxkzznj","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脓血就是血跟大便混在一起的。现在西医讲的大肠癌，大肠炎。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171435-2lsbpc9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-2lsbpc9","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"因为【桃花汤】煮起来是红色的，所以叫桃花汤，并不是说去摘桃花来煮。一般少阴症下痢不止，就危险，就死掉了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171435-6qaggx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-6qaggx4","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桃花汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171435-yx49lbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-yx49lbe","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤石脂一斤，一半全用，一半筛末。干姜一两。粳米一升。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171435-a0rqs3d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-a0rqs3d","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"parent-style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);","style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右三味，以水半升，煮米令熟，去渣，温服七合，纳赤石脂末，方寸匕，日三服，若愈，余勿服。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\" parent-style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312171435-bcquwhx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-bcquwhx","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"少阴症如果下痢不止不管就会死掉啦，治不了痢的时候我们怎么处理。用赤石脂，如果赤石脂一半熟用一半生用，就是告诉你...比如说赤石脂用五钱，两钱半煮，两钱半打碎生用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"主力是赤石脂，干姜在旁边温中，加一点点梗米，能够增润肠的津液"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。梗米是甜米，谷的气能够停里面。这三味药，煮到米熟了就可以停止了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171435-g9tayic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-g9tayic","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7——4"}]},{"ID":"20240312171435-d5qa1wo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171435-d5qa1wo","updated":"20240312171435"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"梗米不能太多，一个汤匙就够了。煮成稀饭汤水状就可以了，多放没有效果。煮好后把残渣滤掉，这个时候呢再放两钱半赤石脂末，两钱半粉末可以分两次服用，搅一搅就可以吞下去了。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"这个药是涩剂，会让食物停在里面排不出去。所以桃花汤跟大黄附子细辛汤刚好是反的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，大黄附子细辛汤是希望排出去，所以用大黄。这里要用涩剂，这个少阴下痢可能一天二三十次，下痢的时候大便都是血，桃花汤能对治它。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171512-ic7fglz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171512-ic7fglz"}},{"ID":"20240312171512-j4z6bnq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171512-j4z6bnq","updated":"20240312171512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第三百二十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171512-8at3v7z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171512-8at3v7z","updated":"20240312171512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：【少阴病】，二三日至四五日，腹痛，小便不利，下利不止，便脓血者，【桃花汤】主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312171512-58fr7xi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312171512-58fr7xi","updated":"20240312171512"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下痢不止的时候，水都排掉了，当然小便都没有了。一定会有腹痛。"}]}]}